        <h1>Hephaestus</h1>
        <p>Hephaestus is a story based spaceflight game born out of my love for spaceflight and the space race of the 
            1960s. The entirety of the physics engine is self made using c++, allowing me to learn about advanced c++ techniques
            and giving me an excuse to learn more about rocket science and orbital mechanics. The publically available code contains 
            the physics engine as well as software to render a scaled model of the solar system as a whole, developed using unreal engine.
            The rest of the game's software will remain close sourced as I would like Hephaestus to be built into a fully fledged game which 
            I would like to be available for sale by mid 2027.
        </p>

